  "title": "The Uncomfortable Middle: Security Challenges Faced by Mid-Size Organizations",
  "summary": "Mar 20, 2025 - Mid-size organizations face unique security challenges: caught between enterprise-level threats and limited resources. This analysis examines seven critical pain points—from staffing constraints and tool proliferation to compliance burdens and cloud security gaps—that create persistent vulnerabilities despite security teams' best efforts.",
